1
00:00:00,584 --> 00:00:02,584
(Penny:)Well...

2
00:00:06,488 --> 00:00:08,358
(Sheldon:)I think I'll be going.

3
00:00:09,258 --> 00:00:11,028
(Leonard:)Sheldon...
No, no, no, no.

4
00:00:11,093 --> 00:00:13,433
(Sheldon:)We are done here.

5
00:00:14,496 --> 00:00:16,666
(sighs)

6
00:00:16,732 --> 00:00:18,632
(Sheldon:)Would you mind
opening the door

7
00:00:18,701 --> 00:00:21,871
(Sheldon:)and then angrily slamming it
behind me?

8
00:00:22,804 --> 00:00:24,304
(Amy:)Sure.

9
00:00:24,373 --> 00:00:26,273
(Amy:)Thank you.

10
00:00:26,342 --> 00:00:27,972
(Sheldon:)And slam it hard,

11
00:00:28,043 --> 00:00:29,743
(Sheldon:)because I am pretty steamed.

12
00:00:32,347 --> 00:00:34,117
(Howard(on phone):)All right, Leonard,
hang in there.

13
00:00:34,182 --> 00:00:36,382
(Howard(on phone):)Talk to you tomorrow.

14
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:40,090
(Mrs Cooper:)What happened?
They just got married.

15
00:00:40,155 --> 00:00:41,555
(sighs)
I don't know.

16
00:00:41,623 --> 00:00:44,923
(Howard:)It's a mess.
They had a huge fight in Vegas.

17
00:00:44,993 --> 00:00:46,163
(Bernadette:)Think they'll break up?

18
00:00:46,228 --> 00:00:48,428
(Howard:)I don't know. Sounds pretty bad.

19
00:00:48,496 --> 00:00:51,236
(Howard:)Penny's back in her apartment
all by herself.

20
00:00:51,299 --> 00:01:02,019
(Raj:)Really?

